{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24940","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 沈传师","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"安期何事出云烟，爲把仙方与世传。\n只向人间称百岁，谁知洞里过千年。\n青牛到日迎方朔，丹竈开时共稚川。\n更说桃源更深处，异花长占四时天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈传师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}